1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:02,697
Your stop keeps getting hit by normal noise?

2
00:00:03,239 --> 00:00:04,573
This indicator can help.

3
00:00:05,073 --> 00:00:10,610
ATR, the average true range, measures how far price typically moves in one candle.

4
00:00:10,958 --> 00:00:13,393
It says nothing about direction, only size.

5
00:00:13,893 --> 00:00:16,299
When the market is calm, ATR is low.

6
00:00:16,707 --> 00:00:18,750
When it's wild, ATR rises.

7
00:00:19,250 --> 00:00:24,662
Many traders use it to size stops. For example, two ATRs away from the entry.

8
00:00:25,001 --> 00:00:28,057
That keeps the stop outside the market's ordinary noise.

9
00:00:28,557 --> 00:00:31,791
ATR is one of the Pro indicators on Meme Street.

10
00:00:32,185 --> 00:00:34,021
Practise at memestreet.net.

